  "description": "Single Speed 26\" Beach Cruiser Bike for Men\n\nThe 26\" Single Speed Beach Cruiser Bike for Men offers a smooth and stylish ride. Built with a durable Hi-ten steel lowrider frame and a comfortable brown leatherette saddle with springs, it’s perfect for relaxed beach cruises. Featuring wide tires, a coaster brake for easy stopping, and a sturdy steel kickstand, this beach cruiser combines comfort and reliability for every ride. Ideal for leisurely rides around town or along the coast.\n\nFRAME\n\nTracer Hi-ten steel Classical 26*18\"\n\nFORK\n\nTracer Hi-ten Steel 3/8\"*22.2*25.4*167*28.6*1.4*367*102mm\n\nSHOCK\n\nN/A\n\nHANDLEBAR\n\nTracer Steel Moon-Type 680*22.2*1.4T\n\nSTEM\n\nSteel 22.2*25.4*180mm Heavy Duty, Ext: 80mm\n\nHEADSET\n\nSteel Diameter 1\"*22.2\"30*27mm, H: 34mm\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nSteel for One Piece Cranks\n\nRIMS\n\nWide:29mm 26*1.75*36H*14G, Black\n\nFRONT HUB\n\nSF-HB03F, 3/8\"*14G*36H*100*140mm\n\nREAR HUB\n\nLC-201R coaster, 3/8*14G*36H*110*150mm\n\nSPOKES\n\nSteel 14G\n\nTIRES\n\nBlack, 26\"x2.125\n\nFENDERS\n\nN/A\n\nMEAS\n\n139*18*68cm\n\nEXTRAS\n\nReflectors, steel kickstand\n\nWEIGHT\n\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
